    <name>Full Steam Ahead</name>
    <summary>A desktop app to import games from other launchers into Steam</summary>
    <description>
        <p>
            Full Steam Ahead scans the game launchers you already use and adds what it finds to
            your Steam library as non-Steam shortcuts, so everything launches from one place.
        </p>
        <p>It reads games from:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>GOG</li>
            <li>Epic Games</li>
            <li>itch.io</li>
            <li>EA app / Origin</li>
            <li>Ubisoft Connect</li>
            <li>Heroic</li>
            <li>Legendary</li>
            <li>Lutris</li>
            <li>Flatpak</li>
            <li>Bottles</li>
            <li>MiniGalaxy</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            Artwork is matched from Steam and SteamGridDB, imports are sorted into collections,
            and every change is shown for review before it is applied. A backup of your Steam
            configuration is taken first, so an import can always be rolled back.
        </p>
    </description>
